'''Meme''' (Meme-Meme while performing a trade) is a {{Mythical}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|1}} and is unobtainable from any shop. It is exclusive to the [[Events#April Fools 2026|April Fools Event]]. 

The Meme fruit allows the user to place down fake [[Blox Fruits]] and explosive traffic cones, as well as fly using traffic cones.

==Obtainment==
* The limited "''REALLY GOOD gacha''" from [[Luckymaxer (NPC)|Luckymaxer]] after defeating the [[Luckymaxer (Raid Boss)|Luckymaxer Raid Boss]].
* [[Trading]]
{{Clr}}

