==Trivia==
* This fruit is almost identical to the original [[Meme (Admin)|Meme]], an admin-exclusive fruit.
* Mastery obtained on this fruit does count towards the Fruits Mastered Count Statistic on [[Player Profile|player profiles]] (previously was thought to not count to Fruits Mastered Statistic).
* The {{Ability|X}} move is almost identical to [[Blade]]'s {{Ability|Blade|F}}.
* The energy cost for both moves are identical to their mastery requirement.
* The [[Meme]] is the cheapest item in the game, costing only {{Money|1}}.
** Despite it not being worth {{Money|1,000,000}}, [[Trevor]] still accepts it as a valid fruit for their quest.
* There is no way to obtain a [[Permanent Blox Fruits|permanent]] version of this fruit.
* The {{Ability|Z}} move has an infinite range.

